## 6.5 Memory smoke tour seed (SMK-PTL-07 / SMK-PTL-08)

When API runs with `STORAGE_DRIVER=memory` and `OPERATOR_SMOKE_E2E_SEED=1`, the shared in-memory tour store seeds **both**:

| Tenant | Host context | Published tour `…0210` |
| ------ | ------------ | ---------------------- |
| `…000014` | `operator.portal.localhost` (SMK-PTL-07) | `ensureOperatorSmokeSeedTour` |
| `…000003` | `portal.denali.club` custom apex (SMK-PTL-08) | `ensureDenaliDevSmokeSeedTour` |

`InMemoryTourRepository` indexes tours by composite `(tenantId, id)` — matching Prisma `@@unique([tenantId, id])` — so the same fixture tour id can exist on both tenants without collision.

---

## 6. Forbidden

- Marketing **write** of `atour_mb_session` (read-only SSR probe is required — PCMS-03-READ / §5.2 / §5.3 / §5.5)
- Marketing `app/api/me/*` / `app/api/public-auth/*` / cookie Domain helpers / persisting JSON `session_token`
- Marketing `createPortalSameOriginGuestAuthTransport` / `GET /api/me/profile` / `PublicCatalogRegistrationFlow` / `completeMemberLoginEgress` / intake hydrate
- `Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *` or CORS on Portal routes other than `/api/public-auth/*` (including `/api/me/*`)
- CORS / cookie `Domain` changes on `apps/api` `/public/auth/*` (browser never calls API; Portal BFF remains the cookie writer)
- Shared cookie across platform tenants on `{club}.{root}` hosts
- Middleware OTP skip (resume decision lives on register **page** server component only)
- Tour registration intake inside the login modal (portal **or** marketing)
- Deleting `/login` without a replacement public host for `/me/*` guest redirects
- Fail-open `/me/*` shell (fallback «عضو» + live nav) when profile BFF returns 401/403/404
- `/me/layout` `redirect("/")` on missing session or tenant mismatch (must expire-session → `/login`)
- Middleware `/me/*` tenant mismatch `redirectHome` to `/` (must login + clear cookie)
- Entitlements **401/403** falling back to local SDK grants (ghost nav)
- Redirecting a dead member session to marketing **without** clearing `atour_mb_session`
- Treating profile **502** / `BACKEND_UNREACHABLE` as logout
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` cookie domain env

---

